THAT DOESN'T MAKE HIM A BAD

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.184 line:78%
PERSON.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.651 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: THIS IS WHY I LIKE

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:54.421 line:78%
BERNIE SANDERS.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.188 line:78%
AS YOU KNOW, EVERYONE HERE ON

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.757 line:78%
"THE FIVE" KNOWS I'M AN EXPERT

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:59.692 line:78%
IN DIVA BEHAVIOR.

