00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:12.205 line:78%
BECAUSE IT KEEPS YOU AWAKE.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:13.173 line:78%
ALSO, I MEAN LIKE, LOOK, HE'S

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:15.942 line:78%
GOT TO GET SOMEWHERE.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:18.211 line:78%
HE CAN USE A PRIVATE PLANE.

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:20.747 line:78%
IT'S EASIER DURING THE CAMPAIGN.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:21.681 line:78%
MY PROBLEM IS THAT AS A

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:24.517 line:78%
