00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:36.296 line:78%
BUT HE SHOULD AT LEAST GET A

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:37.497 line:78%
TASTE OF IT.

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.932 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: DR. SAPHIER, FIRST

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:40.767 line:78%
OF ALL I WOULD LIKE TO THANK YOU

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:42.235 line:78%
FOR ALL OF YOUR GUIDANCE DURING

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.902 line:78%
THE PANDEMIC.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.637 line:78%
YOUR GUIDANCE AND EXPERTISE

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:46.706 line:78%
REALLY HELPED CALM THE WATERS,

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:48.141 line:78%
FOCUS ON WHAT IT TAKES.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.242 line:78%
BERNIE SANDERS IS 79 YEARS OLD,

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:51.778 line:78%
YEAR WERE LIVING AND I AM.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:53.813 line:78%
AT WHAT POINT DO WE SENIORS

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:56.382 line:78%
TYPICALLY NEED EXTRA ATTENTION?

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.984 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dr. Nicole: [LAUGHS]

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.285 line:78%
WHILE I WAS RESEARCHING FOR THIS

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.620 line:78%
EXTREMELY IMPORTANT TOPIC THAT

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.121 line:78%
WE ARE TALKING ABOUT.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.756 line:78%
IT'S VERY SERIOUS.

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.657 line:78%
I HAVE TO ADMIT, THE 60 DEGREES

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.960 line:78%
AND A KING-SIZE BED, THAT SOUNDS

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:08.628 line:78%
QUITE LOVELY TO ME.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.697 line:78%
BUT I REALLY WANT TO KNOW WHAT

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.598 line:78%
THE BLUE BLANKET IS ALL ABOUT.

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.332 line:78%
WHY BLUE?

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:14.067 line:78%
HE HAS GRAY HAIR.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.367 line:78%
YOU CAN DEFINITELY SEE THE GRAY

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.137 line:78%
ON IT.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:18.872 line:78%
THAT IS THE ONLY QUESTION.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.172 line:78%
DID YOU KNOW KANYE WEST, ALL HE

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.741 line:78%
LIKES?

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.675 line:78%
HE JUST WANTS LIP BALM, SHOWER

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:27.347 line:78%
SHOES, AND A LOT OF ALCOHOL.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:29.349 line:78%
THAT SEEMS REASONABLE.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:30.083 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: I WANT SPACED HERE

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:30.884 line:78%
LOTS OF SPACE.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:33.920 line:78%
DANA, DOESN'T EVERYONE WANT LOTS

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:34.721 line:78%
OF SPACE?

