&gt;&gt; Dana: IF YOU EVER HAVE A

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:37.757 line:78%
CHANCE TO FLY ON UP PRIVATE

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:40.160 line:78%
PLANE, YOU DO NOT EVER WANT TO

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:40.860 line:78%
GO BACK.

