00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.001 line:78%
LINUS.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.268 line:78%
THAT'S THE FIRST THING I THOUGHT

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.904 line:78%
OF.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:53.139 line:78%
