00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:58.978 line:78%
DO YOU KNOW HOW MANY GREENHOUSE

00:02:56.376 --> 00:03:01.447 line:78%
GAS EMISSIONS ARE WASTED KEEPING

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:02.315 line:78%
A ROOM AT 60 DEGREES AT ALL

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.416 line:78%
TIMES?

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:06.819 line:78%
THAT IS THE SCANDAL HERE.

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:07.187 line:78%
WE MUST FOLLOW UP ON IT 

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.921 line:78%
TOMORROW.

